1
00:00:06,833 --> 00:00:08,787
Pasukan yang sebelumnya dikirim untuk memperkuat

2
00:00:08,937 --> 00:00:10,771
Benteng Desheng, dua batalion seribu orang,

3
00:00:10,921 --> 00:00:12,793
kini sudah kehilangan separuh kekuatannya.

4
00:00:12,943 --> 00:00:16,111
Pada hari ketiga, Meng Yuanzhong tertembak panah dan gugur di medan perang.

5
00:00:16,261 --> 00:00:19,511
Hingga hari ini, pasukan Benteng Desheng yang masih bisa bertempur

6
00:00:19,661 --> 00:00:21,589
tinggal kurang dari sepertiga jumlah awal

7
00:00:23,061 --> 00:00:24,889
Panah Jenderal Zhao hampir habis

8
00:00:25,039 --> 00:00:26,923
Pohon gelondongan dan batu besar sudah habis

9
00:00:33,206 --> 00:00:36,622
Saudara-saudara, kita hidup dan mati bersama Benteng Desheng!

10
00:00:36,772 --> 00:00:37,834
Bertahan sampai mati!

11
00:00:42,572 --> 00:00:44,772
Jenderal Zhao, perintah militer Kabupaten Longgan!

12
00:00:47,006 --> 00:00:47,788
Perintah militer

13
00:00:48,039 --> 00:00:49,247
Tinggalkan Benteng Desheng

14
00:00:49,397 --> 00:00:51,473
Mundur ke garis pertahanan Punggung Duxiong Gunung Gan

15
00:00:51,623 --> 00:00:53,349
Pertahanan belakang telah selesai dibangun

16
00:00:53,499 --> 00:00:54,471
Laksanakan segera

17
00:00:54,621 --> 00:00:55,303
Jenderal

18
00:00:56,454 --> 00:00:57,276
Kita mundur

19
00:00:59,487 --> 00:01:00,555
Laksanakan perintah!

20
00:01:00,705 --> 00:01:01,817
Bawa semua korban luka

21
00:01:01,967 --> 00:01:03,217
Bawa semua senjata!

22
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:03,972
Mundur!

23
00:01:09,467 --> 00:01:10,549
Luka-luka pergi duluan!

24
00:01:10,699 --> 00:01:11,731
Setiap tim jangan panik!

25
00:01:11,881 --> 00:01:12,523
Ikuti!

26
00:01:14,048 --> 00:01:15,844
Serbu masuk dan rebut benteng dalam!

27
00:01:23,081 --> 00:01:23,613
Kosong!

28
00:01:27,314 --> 00:01:27,806
Jenderal!

29
00:01:28,081 --> 00:01:29,173
Tidak ada orang di benteng

30
00:01:29,323 --> 00:01:30,837
Pasukan Wilayah Selatan sudah mundur

31
00:01:34,890 --> 00:01:35,852
Semua waspada!

32
00:01:36,002 --> 00:01:37,134
Cek masih ada orang lain?

33
00:01:41,402 --> 00:01:42,124
Jenderal Muda

34
00:01:42,274 --> 00:01:44,178
Orang-orang Rendo Xifeng tidak mundur semalaman

35
00:01:44,328 --> 00:01:45,430
Mereka terus mengawasi

36
00:01:48,394 --> 00:01:49,494
ternyata belum pergi

37
00:01:49,661 --> 00:01:50,553
Semalam berlalu

38
00:01:50,703 --> 00:01:52,171
Pertahanan justru makin kokoh

39
00:02:06,137 --> 00:02:08,147
Di depan ada rintangan kayu dan kuda-kuda penolak

40
00:02:08,297 --> 00:02:09,615
di belakangnya busur dan panah

41
00:02:09,765 --> 00:02:11,213
lalu diikuti pasukan infanteri

42
00:02:11,363 --> 00:02:12,857
sebagai barisan terakhir

43
00:02:13,007 --> 00:02:15,359
Pertahanan Rendo Xifeng ini cukup kokoh

44
00:02:15,841 --> 00:02:17,619
Tapi pasukannya memang terbatas

45
00:02:17,769 --> 00:02:18,851
Tidak mungkin setiap titik

46
00:02:19,001 --> 00:02:20,165
dijaga seketat itu

47
00:02:20,435 --> 00:02:23,315
Di balik semak kiri, lebarnya sekitar 50 langkah

48
00:02:23,465 --> 00:02:26,367
Rintangan tanduk rusa jarang, kuda-kuda kayu juga cuma satu baris

49
00:02:26,632 --> 00:02:27,224
Huchen

50
00:02:27,665 --> 00:02:28,077
Siap!

51
00:02:28,732 --> 00:02:30,050
celah di balik semak itu,

52
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:30,892
atau tidak?

53
00:02:31,567 --> 00:02:32,139
Terlihat

54
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:35,978
Bawa seratus anggota pasukan khusus menyelinap ke sana

55
00:02:36,128 --> 00:02:38,238
Setelah sampai di sana, jangan terburu-buru bertindak!

56
00:02:38,388 --> 00:02:39,732
Tunggu sampai aku mengalihkan

57
00:02:39,882 --> 00:02:41,208
perhatian mereka dari depan

58
00:02:41,358 --> 00:02:42,868
Gunakan busur silang Qinghe

59
00:02:45,091 --> 00:02:47,649
Sasar para operator mesin pelontar batu

60
00:02:47,799 --> 00:02:48,591
Tembak mereka

61
00:02:49,099 --> 00:02:51,515
Satu putaran tembakan selesai, langsung mundur!

62
00:02:51,966 --> 00:02:52,598
Mengerti!

63
00:02:56,399 --> 00:02:58,393
Tunggu sampai mereka masuk ke zona tembak terbaik

64
00:02:58,543 --> 00:02:59,185
Kali ini,

65
00:02:59,443 --> 00:03:01,089
butakan mata Rendo Xifeng

66
00:03:01,776 --> 00:03:02,658
Sudah sampai

67
00:03:03,076 --> 00:03:03,598
Chongshan!

68
00:03:03,748 --> 00:03:04,160
Siap!

69
00:03:05,215 --> 00:03:07,073
Tarik 300 prajurit perisai ke depan

70
00:03:07,215 --> 00:03:08,819
Buat seolah-olah akan menyerang

71
00:03:08,969 --> 00:03:10,605
Semakin besar suaranya, semakin baik

72
00:03:10,755 --> 00:03:11,117
Ingat

73
00:03:11,989 --> 00:03:14,011
Jangan sampai benar-benar menabrak rintangan mereka

74
00:03:14,161 --> 00:03:15,133
Siap, Jenderal!

75
00:03:19,294 --> 00:03:20,782
Maju, formasi perisai!

76
00:03:24,128 --> 00:03:25,260
Pemanah, maju!

77
00:03:25,410 --> 00:03:26,944
Batu pelontar, dorong keluar!

78
00:03:31,777 --> 00:03:32,649
Mereka keluar!

79
00:03:32,799 --> 00:03:34,347
Semua posisi siap tembak!

80
00:03:36,132 --> 00:03:36,714
Serang!

81
00:03:47,465 --> 00:03:48,287
Bunuh semua!

82
00:03:48,999 --> 00:03:50,067
Hancurkan benteng!

83
00:03:51,099 --> 00:03:52,913
Ada panah silang, cepat sembunyi!

84
00:03:53,765 --> 00:03:55,283
Tarik kembali mesin pelontar!

85
00:03:55,433 --> 00:03:55,825
Cepat!

86
00:03:59,566 --> 00:04:00,108
Berhenti!

87
00:04:00,258 --> 00:04:00,860
Mundur!

88
00:04:04,524 --> 00:04:05,482
Tembak ke sana!

89
00:04:15,691 --> 00:04:17,827
Daya tembak garis depan belum lumpuh total,

90
00:04:17,977 --> 00:04:18,889
Tapi serangan ini

91
00:04:19,110 --> 00:04:20,260
sudah menghancurkan

92
00:04:20,410 --> 00:04:22,088
kekuatan panah dan batu lempar mereka

93
00:04:22,238 --> 00:04:23,504
yang paling diandalkan

94
00:04:24,438 --> 00:04:25,250
Dirikan tenda

95
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:25,792
Ya

96
00:04:30,067 --> 00:04:31,429
Kau punya rintangan kayu

97
00:04:31,579 --> 00:04:32,899
Aku punya busur silang Qinghe

98
00:04:33,049 --> 00:04:34,371
Kau punya mesin pelontar

99
00:04:34,521 --> 00:04:36,751
Aku akan habisi dulu operator katapultmu!

100
00:04:37,487 --> 00:04:38,823
Kalau tidak keluar hari ini,

101
00:04:38,973 --> 00:04:39,835
Lanjut besok

102
00:04:40,207 --> 00:04:41,059
Besok lagi

103
00:04:41,107 --> 00:04:42,327
Kalau begitu, lusa

104
00:04:42,477 --> 00:04:43,369
Rendo Xifeng

105
00:04:43,943 --> 00:04:45,335
Kita habisi mereka pelan-pelan

106
00:04:52,377 --> 00:04:53,599
Kalau terus menyerang,

107
00:04:53,677 --> 00:04:55,545
bisakah kita merebut Komando Militer Deshun?

108
00:04:58,277 --> 00:05:00,385
Pertempuran ini, aku kalah langkah

109
00:05:02,243 --> 00:05:03,239
Kirim Chengzhong

110
00:05:07,143 --> 00:05:08,599
Jenderal Muda ada utusan

111
00:05:10,977 --> 00:05:12,587
Jendral tua seperti Rendo Xifeng

112
00:05:12,737 --> 00:05:13,761
akan mudah menyerah

113
00:05:15,470 --> 00:05:16,012
Berhenti!

114
00:05:17,503 --> 00:05:18,625
Bawa orangnya ke sini

115
00:05:18,775 --> 00:05:19,983
Geledah dan tutup matanya!

116
00:05:20,133 --> 00:05:20,505
Siap!

117
00:05:28,333 --> 00:05:29,421
Umurmu masih muda

118
00:05:29,571 --> 00:05:30,613
tapi sudah berani

119
00:05:30,705 --> 00:05:32,539
Rendo Xifeng yang menyuruhmu datang

120
00:05:32,689 --> 00:05:33,737
Benar, Jenderal

121
00:05:34,255 --> 00:05:35,891
Apa jabatanmu di bawahnya?

122
00:05:36,789 --> 00:05:38,251
Aku bukan bawahannya.

123
00:05:39,955 --> 00:05:41,417
Aku putra Rendo Xifeng,

124
00:05:41,755 --> 00:05:42,745
Rendo Chengzhong.

125
00:05:44,289 --> 00:05:46,487
Ayahku menyuruhku menghubungi Jenderal.

126
00:05:46,637 --> 00:05:49,073
Aku dan ayah ingin bergabung dengan Wilayah Selatan

127
00:05:49,223 --> 00:05:51,819
Kau bilang Rendo Xifeng ingin bergabung dengan Wilayah Selatan

128
00:05:51,969 --> 00:05:53,561
Bagaimana aku bisa percaya padamu?

129
00:05:54,835 --> 00:05:56,761
Jenderal tidak perlu langsung mempercayai saya

130
00:05:57,969 --> 00:05:59,389
Jenderal cukup asumsikan

131
00:05:59,669 --> 00:06:01,529
niat ayahku untuk menyerah itu benar

132
00:06:01,679 --> 00:06:03,071
Jika syaratnya terpenuhi

133
00:06:03,221 --> 00:06:04,657
Ayahku akan mengikuti

134
00:06:04,921 --> 00:06:06,675
permintaan Jenderal, selangkah demi selangkah

135
00:06:06,825 --> 00:06:07,973
Tak perlu percaya dulu

136
00:06:08,123 --> 00:06:09,667
Yang penting kita bahas syaratnya dulu

137
00:06:09,817 --> 00:06:11,397
Sepertinya kau sudah sangat siap

138
00:06:11,551 --> 00:06:11,863
Baik

139
00:06:12,984 --> 00:06:14,378
Kalau begitu katakan padaku,

140
00:06:14,528 --> 00:06:15,698
kenapa kalian menyerah?

141
00:06:17,928 --> 00:06:19,186
Jenderal masih muda

142
00:06:19,336 --> 00:06:21,974
tak tahu seberapa banyak yang Anda ketahui tentang Klan Rendo kami

143
00:06:22,124 --> 00:06:23,140
Silakan bicara

144
00:06:23,491 --> 00:06:26,027
Ayahku berasal dari cabang Klan Rendo di Wilayah Barat

145
00:06:26,177 --> 00:06:28,295
dan kini menjabat sebagai Komandan Pasukan

146
00:06:28,445 --> 00:06:30,171
di Komando Pengawas Militer Xishoubaotai

147
00:06:30,321 --> 00:06:32,333
Kali ini kalah bertempur melawan Jenderal,

148
00:06:32,483 --> 00:06:34,071
jika kami kembali ke Wilayah Barat,

149
00:06:34,221 --> 00:06:37,079
Keluarga kerajaan Xia Barat memang sudah curiga pada Klan Rendo.

150
00:06:37,229 --> 00:06:39,405
Tanggung jawab atas kekalahan ini akan ditimpakan

151
00:06:39,555 --> 00:06:41,637
Ayahku, aku, beserta seribu

152
00:06:41,787 --> 00:06:43,925
prajurit setia kami pasti akan dihabisi!

153
00:06:43,987 --> 00:06:45,607
Itulah alasan pertama ayahku

154
00:06:45,757 --> 00:06:47,237
ingin membelot ke Wilayah Selatan

155
00:06:47,657 --> 00:06:48,459
Lanjutkan

156
00:06:51,857 --> 00:06:54,673
Klan kami sudah lama punya preseden untuk kembali ke Wilayah Selatan

157
00:06:54,823 --> 00:06:56,893
Dahulu, tetua klan kami Rendo Yaozhen

158
00:06:57,043 --> 00:06:58,851
diam-diam menghubungi wilayah Xihe

159
00:06:59,001 --> 00:07:01,015
merencanakan penyerahan diri ke Wilayah Selatan

160
00:07:01,165 --> 00:07:03,965
Saat itu Panglima Tertinggi Hu Shenzhi mengajukan syarat

